## Additional information
I'm not familiar enough with windowing in general, `winit` or how `bevy_winit` uses it to track down where exactly the error originates from, but I ran a handful of the `winit` examples I deemed relevant and didn't encounter any issues there, so I'm bringing it up here for now.
